# Git and deploy

- Do not create git commits unless the user explicitly asks in that message.
- Do not push, force-push, or amend unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not deploy to Firebase, Hosting, Functions, or any production/staging target unless the user explicitly asks. That includes `firebase deploy`, plugin deploy tools, and Secret Manager writes that exist only to ship.
- Implement and verify locally (emulators, unit tests, lint). Production deploy is a separate step after the full local implementation, not after each phase.
